317"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c06683c6e72e825096c2d90f9c1f4d8487d9ea3da6e522029bac0d8d80506d1a","event_uuid":"1b70ae2b-a44a-47d3-82cf-5790ac4063be","position":{"commit_sha":"c726d78e821c7629c539a86c1f85ae6e2de5aa24","position":"1793669170258959413-1b70ae2b-a44a-47d3-82cf-5790ac4063be"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"2f59e1b73910286dd43b7f07d478484bc74dc7ad424e5e3fcb711a4b57e7fb32","event_uuid":"bb4f21b9-bfe9-475b-bfde-52fe06ac12a6","position":{"commit_sha":"c9f7f58b21889949e6cad81287317b995d13e4cd","position":"1793669178256732809-bb4f21b9-bfe9-475b-bfde-52fe06ac12a6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"duplicate","comments":[],"completion_expectation":"disposition","created_at":1793669101736320636,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0fe9288a-4261-4337-bec4-d6441d733317","relation":"duplicates","target_id":"eab1-6089-e968-4d8f"}],"description":"## Observation\n\nThe store write path bounds `git add`, `git commit`, `git rm`, `checkout` and `reset` at 30 s (`event_commit_git._GIT_TIMEOUT = 30`, applied by `_run_git`). That bound was set to match the push bound (bug c2ba; `tests/unit/test_store_write_git_timeout_c2ba.py` pins `event_append._GIT_TIMEOUT == push._GIT_TIMEOUT`).\n\nOn 2026-10-27 at ~18:40 PDT a local `rebar edit` on the main checkout's tracker failed with `git commit failed while holding lock: git timed out after 30s` (recorded on bug `affordable-omphacite-sunfish`). The same tracker measured 213,713 index entries; with its stat cache invalidated, every index-refreshing git command cost ~49 s (`git status --porcelain`), so a commit that refreshes the index cannot finish inside 30 s there.\n\nThe report itself is accurate: the error text names the timeout. The question this ticket raises is the bound, not the message.\n\n## Why it matters\n\n`git commit -- <paths>` and `git add` refresh the index, so their cost grows with the number of index entries, not with the network. The sync path had the same shape (bug `painted-epidermal-shelduck`), and its fix moved local sync operations to gitutil's existing 120 s `_LOCAL_GIT_TIMEOUT`, keeping 30 s for `fetch`. `gitutil.run_git_write` already uses that 120 s local bound. The event write path is the remaining store path that bounds local index work at the network bound, and a timed-out write is a lost write that the user has to redo.\n\n## Open design question (needs an owner decision)\n\nc2ba chose 30 s deliberately: the write path holds the store write lock, and a short bound releases it quickly after a stalled volume. Raising it trades faster lock release for writes that succeed on large or stat-dirty stores. The prior decision record for c2ba should be read before changing it.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The c2ba decision record is read and the trade-off (lock-hold time vs. failing large-store commits) is decided and recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] If the bound changes: local index operations in `event_commit_git` use a bound sized for local work, the c2ba pin test is updated to assert the new relationship, and a regression test covers it.\n- [ ] If the bound stays: the reason is recorded here and in the `_GIT_TIMEOUT` comment in `event_commit_git.py`.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1b70ae2b-a44a-47d3-82cf-5790ac4063be","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["tracker","store-write","timeout"],"ticket_id":"71ae-2806-d04d-4f29","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Store event writes bound git add/commit at the 30 s push bound; a commit on a large or stat-dirty tracker times out and the write is lost","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1088ae7c-d5dc-4ac3-b923-133fee491901","0fe9288a-4261-4337-bec4-d6441d733317","1b70ae2b-a44a-47d3-82cf-5790ac4063be","bb4f21b9-bfe9-475b-bfde-52fe06ac12a6"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793685082505634001,"uuid":"d9f050b1-0ee0-4480-9880-308b82e24166"}